  "instructions": [
    "preheat grill to 400degrees.",
    "thread beef cubes onto skewers, leaving a little space between each piece.",
    "in a large bowl, whisk together lemon juice, olive oil, mustard, garlic, oregano, salt, and pepper.",
    "add the beef skewers to the marinade and mix to coat, then cover with plastic wrap.",
    "refrigerate for at least 30 minutes or up to 2 hours.",
    "thread lemon slices onto the skewers, then place the skewers on the grill.",
    "close the grill lid and cook for 8-10 minutes, turning occasionally.",
    "move the skewers to a plate and let them rest for 5 minutes before serving.",
    "garnish with bay leaves and scallions.",
    "serve immediately, with additional lemon wedges on the side if desired."
